		</b></font> <font size="-2" face="Verdana, Arial">- 
		10:30 PM 
		</font><BR>
    
		It's that time again for a Sunday meeting.  We're planning on having a meeting at 10 pm EST tomorrow in the Arena just like last time.  All are welcome to come, hope to see you there.  I'll try and keep a leash on Bertha this time.
		
