		</b></font> <font size="-2" face="Verdana, Arial">- 
		10:28 PM 
		</font><BR>
    
		A reminder to those who signed up, tomorrow the blades are going to be in Burning Woods at 4pm EST in order to take out Ixiblat for part of the Cleric epic quest.  Hope to see you there to help Bakin get his rez stick.  Ixiblat will probably be taken down atleast 3 times, and possibly as many as 5 or 6 times depending on how many clerics who are ready we have with us.
		
