		</b></font> <font size="-2" face="Verdana, Arial">- 
		05:19 PM 
		</font><BR>
    
		Remember who you hate!  Er, I mean, we're going to be raiding the Plane of Hate tomorrow (Saturday).  The raid starts at 1 pm EST.  If you are participating, be at the Wizard Spires in South Ro atleast 30 minutes ahead of time so we can get things started.  Groups will be posted in <a href="http://pub13.ezboard.com/fbrellserilisschedulingplaneofhate.showMessage?topicID=328.topic">this thread</a> tonight.  Thanks for signing up folks, may we all have a blast tomorrow.
		
