		</b></font> <font size="-2" face="Verdana, Arial">- 
		05:18 PM 
		</font><BR>
    
		The wedding of Marcielle and Ladara will take place on Tuesday the 20th at 10 pm EST on the shores of North Ro near the shrine.  Everyone is invited to come wish them happiness and, of course, party like there's no tomorrow after the wedding!
		
