		</b></font> <font size="-2" face="Verdana, Arial">- 
		11:17 AM 
		</font><BR>
    
		On Wednesday the 21st at 10 pm EST we're heading into Mistmoore to collect my rent check from Mayong.  Hey, when I said I own that place I wasn't kidding!  Well, actually our target will be Xicotl primarily for Marc's Soulfire.  We'd like to have a good time slaughtering baddies all night in MM, please let Marc know if you plan on helping us out.  How many people we have who plan on coming will determine how much of a total slaughter fest we have that night.  Seeya there!
		
